WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.939
Watch and read: Ama asks: As you read about a green mango tree, what should you

00:00:04.939 --> 00:00:05.235
imagine?

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.237
The answer is: a green mango tree. Visualising means making a picture in your mind.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.917
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which detail will help you picture “a green mango tree”?

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:22.135
The answer is: green. Colours and shapes can help form mental images.
